# Netlify routing for this single-page app.
#
# Real pages are served the app with status 200. Anything else is served
# the same app (which shows the "Page not found" screen) but with status
# 404, so search engines do not index mistyped URLs as real pages.
#
# IMPORTANT: when you add a new page to src/App.jsx, add its path here too,
# or it will load fine but report itself to search engines as "not found".

/about          /index.html   200
/our-work       /index.html   200
/gallery        /index.html   200
/get-involved   /index.html   200
/donate         /index.html   200
/contact        /index.html   200

/*              /index.html   404
